It has a lot to do with processing styles, bottom-up versus top-down. And if you're autistic, you're more likely to be that one.

4
00:00:27,270 --> 00:00:33,490
If you're a bottom-up processor, you might notice small errors like typos or minor inaccuracies, even if others don't.

5
00:00:33,630 --> 00:00:36,150
Prefer having all the details before forming a conclusion.

6
00:00:36,610 --> 00:00:39,230
