10
00:00:51,790 --> 00:00:57,250
If you're a top-down processor, you might form a big-picture understanding, even with limited information.

11
00:00:57,810 --> 00:01:00,470
Fill in gaps with assumptions, context, or prior knowledge.

12
00:01:00,750 --> 00:01:03,230
Value efficiency and be able to overlook small errors.

13
00:01:03,810 --> 00:01:05,470
Find detailed explanations unnecessary.

14
00:01:06,090 --> 00:01:09,190
Be able to summarize the key points rather than focusing on details.

15
00:01:09,630 --> 00:01:13,730
